@@ -28,7 +28,8 @@ from the To, Cc and Bcc headers:
 msmtp -t < message.eml
 #+END_EXAMPLE
 
-lab-mail delivers mail for =lab-devel@p7x.dev= to the list, and
+lab-mail delivers mail for =lab-devel@p7x.dev=, =lab@lists.p7x.dev=,
