diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-mail/README.org b/jails/instances/lab-mail/README.org
index 579d77fe..ee35a149 100644
--- a/jails/instances/lab-mail/README.org
+++ b/jails/instances/lab-mail/README.org
@@ -50,7 +50,10 @@ client --SMTP--> OpenSMTPD 127.0.0.1:2525 --LMTP--> Dovecot --> INBOX
 rc(8) starts OpenSMTPD when the jail starts; its config is
 =/usr/local/etc/mail/smtpd.conf=. A client connects without logging
 in. OpenSMTPD sorts each recipient:
-- =lab-devel@p7x.dev= is delivered to the list.
+- =lab-devel@p7x.dev=, =lab@lists.p7x.dev=, and
+  =freebsd-ports@lists.p7x.dev= are delivered to the list. The table
